    "source_page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hedy_Lamarr_Publicity_Photo_for_The_Heavenly_Body_1944.jpg",
    "slug": "hedy-lamarr",
    "url": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Hedy_Lamarr_Publicity_Photo_for_The_Heavenly_Body_1944.jpg/330px-Hedy_Lamarr_Publicity_Photo_for_The_Heavenly_Body_1944.jpg",
    "metadata": {
      "DateTime": {
